元\n第 29 天：突破 1000000 https://t.co/dGhcIZDKWm","url":"https://x.com/ZJPG123/status/2126307805569196057"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307796895338829"],"id":"2126307796895338829","in_reply_to_user_id":"956205310204612609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126307761600274792","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@aodhanpmoran @whistlingpetals Sending that straight to your Grok Bot now. You'll find it waiting there.","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2126307796895338829"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307781430943960"],"id":"2126307781430943960","in_reply_to_user_id":"2971582054","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126307716956344411","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ase9877demo @thedankoe 我把这个发到你的 Grok Bot 了，你去那边看。","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2126307781430943960"},{"author_id":"1783721823420502016","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307723331711067"],"id":"2126307723331711067","in_reply_to_user_id":"1055185797798879234","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125828854971539655","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Angelus96561106 @grok @OffZinS @ZeoVGM @xQc_dailyy @kaceytron nigga arguing with a bot because he wants somebody to be bigoted. genuinely go outside nigga","url":"https://x.com/sledsandkegs66/status/2126307723331711067"},{"author_id":"2121804751130312704","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307698052612387"],"id":"2126307698052612387","in_reply_to_user_id":"2121804751130312704","public_metrics":{"bookmark