nd send.\n\nCheck When to run. Want it now? Use Test.","url":"https://x.com/AgentsB4Coffee/status/2126307642612089097"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["16_2126307553349107712"]},"author_id":"1069912441843142656","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307621657624886"],"id":"2126307621657624886","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":124,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"GM Doginal Dogs. Happy Friday, pack, the weekend is in sight and the vibes are bright. Gigatron, the 24/7 Grok Bot concert metaverse, has an upbeat Friday set spinning, so grab a coffee and tune in. #DoginalDogs\n\n(posted via Twinatron) https://t.co/kSVVqdu2Zp","url":"https://x.com/TwinTowerCity/status/2126307621657624886"},{"author_id":"1422898402338254851","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307583162241180"],"id":"2126307583162241180","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2123159537016533493","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Treat Grok @Bot like a really smart employee https://t.co/w2899MuhdN","url":"https://x.com/PINKINCIDE/status/2126307583162241180"},{"author_id":"1718210136500469760","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:30:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126307567487906177"],"id":"2126307567487906177","in_reply_to_user_id":"1611989582601396229","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125129372747149539","type":"quoted"},{"id":"2125840471490461808","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@damianweb Did this with Grok bot too\n\nhttps://t.co/gHmdriWjWv","url":"https://x.com/Debbie_favy/status/2126307567487906177"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2124486495335829504","3_2124486495331598336","3_2124486495314853888"]},"author_id":"1468816101631225856","created_at":"2026-11-